WEBVTT

00:09:28.322 --> 00:09:30.640
They are not an objective reality;

00:09:30.664 --> 00:09:34.330
they are not some biological effect
about homo sapiens.

00:09:34.719 --> 00:09:38.518
Take a human being,
cut him open, look inside,

00:09:38.542 --> 00:09:43.669
you will find the heart, the kidneys,
neurons, hormones, DNA,

00:09:43.693 --> 00:09:45.581
but you won't find any rights.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:50.121
The only place you find rights
are in the stories

00:09:50.145 --> 00:09:54.278
that we have invented and spread around
over the last few centuries.

00:09:54.607 --> 00:09:59.537
They may be very positive stories,
very good stories,

00:09:59.561 --> 00:10:03.124
but they're still just fictional stories
that we've invented.